# Phone portrait (DPR 3): the stacked top bar, status strip and bottom pad; a finger selects a tile, marks it,
# tries every digit on the pad (refusals count mistakes), erases, then Hint taps solve the grid.
# viewport 390x844@3
until 300 Mistakes 0
frames 150
touch Cell row 9, column 9:
frames 5
touch Hint (H)
frames 5
touch =Erase
frames 5
touch Mark (N)
frames 5
expect marked, empty
touch =1
frames 3
touch =2
frames 3
touch =3
frames 3
touch =4
frames 3
touch =5
frames 3
save phone-play
touch =Erase
frames 5
touch =Practice
frames 10
expect Easy
repeat 900 until Sanctuary complete
  touch Hint (H)
  frames 1
end
frames 20
expect Total
save phone-results
